    </p><a href="/">← Home</a><pagefind-searchbox></pagefind-searchbox><script type="module" src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/static/pagefind.js"></script><h1 class="register-section" data-pagefind-body="1" data-pagefind-weight="10" data-pagefind-sort="title">NVHCR_EL2</h1><p class="insn_subtitle" data-pagefind-body="1">Nested Virtual Hypervisor Configuration Register</p><div data-pagefind-body="1">
        <p>Provides storage for a virtual view of <a href="AArch64-hcr_el2.html">HCR_EL2</a> under nested virtualization. Except for the TGE bit, all bits in this register are simply stateful and have no effect on PE behavior.</p>
      </div><h3>Configuration</h3><p>This register is present only when FEAT_NV3 is implemented and FEAT_AA64 is implemented. Otherwise, direct accesses to NVHCR_EL2 are <span class="arm-defined-word">UNDEFINED</span>.</p><h3>Attributes</h3>
        <p>NVHCR_EL2 is a 64-bit register.</p>
