    <p>The reset behavior of this field is:</p><ul><li>On a Warm reset, 
      this field resets
       to an architecturally <span class="arm-defined-word">UNKNOWN</span> value.</li></ul><p>Accessing this field has the following behavior:</p><ul><li>Access to this field is <span class="access_level">RO</span> if all the following are true:<ul><li>FEAT_SRMASK2 is implemented.</li><li>EL1 is the current Exception level.</li><li>EL3 is not implemented or SCR2_EL3.SRMASK2En == '1'.</li><li>NVHCRMASK_EL2.TWEDEL == '1'.</li></ul></li></ul></div><h4 id="fieldset_0-63_60-2"> <span class="condition">Otherwise</span>:
